        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-30T02:43:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>[quote=““Horrid Cacophony””]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">One-shot</span><br>\nDestroy (H) hero ongoing cards.<br>\nDeal each non-villain target (H) minus 2 sonic damage.<br>\n[/quote]</p>\n<p>Usually, a source is always associated with a damage being dealt, even for one-shots. However, Horrid Cacophony did not state the source of its damage dealt. Even Falling Statuary says “<span class=\"bbcode-b\">This card</span> deals the target…”.</p>\n<p>So, back to the question, what/who is the source of the damage written on Horrid Cacophony?</p>\n<p>This may have some impact on the game.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:42.927Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
