        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Horrid Cacophony\"\"]\n[b]One-shot[/b]\nDestroy (H) hero ongoing cards.\nDeal each non-villain target (H) minus 2 sonic damage.\n[/quote]\n\n\nUsually, a source is always associated with a damage being dealt, even for one-shots. However, Horrid Cacophony did not state the source of its damage dealt. Even Falling Statuary says \"[b]This card[/b] deals the target...\".\n\nSo, back to the question, what/who is the source of the damage written on Horrid Cacophony?\n\nThis may have some impact on the game.",
