        "created_at": "2012-05-30T02:48:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My guess would either be damage is dealt by The Matriarch (as she is always guarenteed to be an available target), or the damage comes from nothing, like a good deal of environment cards from the core set.  Though, in general, it appears that damage listed on villain cards tend to come from villain targets.</p>",
