        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-30T08:20:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All the cards were the damage comes from villain are things like punches, a gun being wielded by the villain, drugs coursing through their system etc; thematically the damage from Horrid Cacophony comes from all the birds making noise at the same time (and breaking the hero’s concentration, removing ongoings), this suggests a source other than the villain, I suspect the “This card” clause is missing from it.</p>",
